{{ENExclusive}}
'''Felix the Cat Duke Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a Stamp Reward during the [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 744
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Felix the Cat Duke Cat
|name2 = Mercenary Leader Felix Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mercenary Leader Felix Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Although his 100% chance for a Critical Hit may sound useful on paper, like [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]] before him, his horrible damage ruined any chance he had at being good. On top of poor damage, he also has low health, even lower range and a decently long recharge time. As a result, he is usually not worth bringing outside of very specific stages, like [[Steel Visage (Deadly)|Facing Danger]] and [[Forged to Kill (Deadly)|Forged to Kill]] (with support), where he actually excels as a much faster and more accessible [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]]. This is his only niche.

